HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc1_0:
	.string "And there do I see my father. My son.\n"
	.string "My life.\p"
	.string "And there do I see nature. POKéMON.\n"
	.string "The world.$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc1::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc1_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc2_0:
	.string "The art of crafting things fatigues\n"
	.string "one’s spirit.\p"
	.string "When the spirit is healed, the desire to\n"
	.string "make something returns.\p"
	.string "It is such a wondrous cycle.$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc2::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc2_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc3_0:
	.string "When people and POKéMON join hands,\n"
	.string "everyone’s happy.\p"
	.string "It makes everyone come together. It\n"
	.string "could even make the world one!$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc3::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc3_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc4_0:
	.string "That people are lonely is only natural.\n"
	.string "It gives me compassion for others.\p"
	.string "It’s what makes me look forward to a\n"
	.string "better tomorrow.\p"
	.string "But there are still moments of\n"
	.string "fondness for the past.\p"
	.string "Though, time can heal some sadness...$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc4::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc4_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc5_0:
	.string "There are still words that not\n"
	.string "everyone can describe...\p"
	.string "The words are “love” and “joy.”$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc5::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc5_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc6_0:
	.string "POKéMON... People... It’s only natural\n"
	.string "that we are all so very different.\p"
	.string "Make sure that you never judge a\n"
	.string "POKéMON on if it’s weak or strong.\p"
	.string "You must always look for the good\n"
	.string "inside of them. That’s what counts!$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc6::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc6_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc7_0:
	.string "Mind and matter.\p"
	.string "It’s no good if one is stronger than\n"
	.string "the other.\p"
	.string "Balance is what’s needed. That’s the\n"
	.string "key.$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc7::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc7_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc8_0:
	.string "We cannot read the minds of others,\n"
	.string "which causes us to feel fear and\l"
	.string "doubt.\p"
	.string "But to control the aspects of the\n"
	.string "world beyond our senses is an\l"
	.string "impossibility.$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc8::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc8_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
	release
	end

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc9_0:
	.string "If the strong and able do too much,\n"
	.string "they limit the contributions of others.\p"
	.string "The strong must show restraint.\p"
	.string "This enables everyone to live together\n"
	.string "and share responsibility.$"

HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_EventScript_PtNpc9::
	lock
	faceplayer
	msgbox HearthomeCity_ForeignBuilding_Text_PtNpc9_0, MSGBOX_DEFAULT
